  "description": "Global database of 5,218,380 cell tower locations collected by the OpenCellID community (snapshot 2026-05-01). Each tower is a point with its radio technology (LTE, GSM, UMTS, NR, CDMA), network identifiers (mcc, net, area, cell), estimated range in metres, number of measurement samples, average signal and creation/update timestamps. Mirror of the CARTO Data Observatory dataset `infrastructure_celltowers_glo_latlon_v1_snapshot_v1`, republished as a single hilbert-sorted GeoParquet file.",
